    "Same model/settings, task and input for both arms; fresh agent per task; arm order alternates by repeat.",
    "Both use a persistent Python process and may compose calls, cache values and materialize results. DuckDB connection and temporary tables persist.",
    "Handoff setup materializes the same subset before the agent starts; setup time is reported separately and included in total.",
    "No internal product model calls; models run only in this optional external harness.",
    "I/O counters differ: RowTrail reports physical source/result bytes, DuckDB profiles report original-source scanned rows. Null means not measured, never zero.",
